sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Academic Admin
    participant UI as React + Vite Frontend
    participant DB as Supabase PostgreSQL
    participant API as Spring Boot REST API

    Admin->>UI: Generate timetable
    UI->>DB: Read active rooms, courses, sections, faculty, slots
    DB-->>UI: Return entity snapshot
    UI->>API: POST /api/generate
    activate API
    Note over API: Java Google OR-Tools CP-SAT runs in process
    API->>API: Create assignment variables and constraints
    API->>API: Optimize timetable objective
    alt Feasible
        API-->>UI: 200 success with entries
        UI->>DB: Save draft timetable version and entries
        UI-->>Admin: Show generated draft
    else Infeasible
        API->>API: Diagnose relaxed constraint groups
        API-->>UI: 200 infeasible with causes
        UI-->>Admin: Show diagnosis
    end
    deactivate API
